StageNotePatchRequest.description:
Body for PATCH .../stages/{n}/stage-note (#1376): the stage note's new
text (empty or null clears it) and the audit revision the client loaded;
a stale one is a 409 like the events PUT.

post.description:
Store the event's logo: a PNG, JPEG, WebP or checked SVG, sniffed and capped
like a shooter's (``identity.sniff_logo``), never trusted by name;
the previous file is removed.

get.description:
The newest reel whose file is still there, from the export history;
404 without one. On the share surface (``_SHARE_PATH_RE``) this is what
the share page plays.
